  "description": {
    "en": "The Tecnifibre FIRE 300 is the most power-oriented model in the FIRE range, combining explosive performance, comfort and easy acceleration. It features a 100 sq.in head, 300 g unstrung weight, 320 mm balance and a 16x19 string pattern. X-DAMP technology uses a steel component housed in an elastomer pocket inside the handle to counter impact vibration, reducing harmful vibration by 36% and helping reduce arm fatigue. Compared with the previous generation, the frame sections are more square and approximately 5% thinner to improve stability and power control, while weight has been redistributed toward the center of the frame to reduce swingweight and improve racquet-head acceleration.",

    "zh": "Tecnifibre FIRE 300 是 FIRE 系列中最偏力量输出的型号，强调爆发力、舒适性与快速挥拍。球拍采用100平方英寸拍面、300克空拍重量、320毫米平衡点及16×19开放式线床。核心 X-DAMP 技术通过在手柄内部设置钢制部件与弹性体结构，使其在击球时产生反向运动，从而减少约36%的有害震动并降低手臂疲劳。相比上一代，拍框截面更接近方形且整体薄约5%，以提升稳定性和力量控制，同时将重量从拍框两端重新分配至中心区域，降低挥重并提升拍头加速能力。整体非常适合现代底线进攻型球员。"
  },

